			(property "Description" "Universal GPS/GNSS L1 receiver front end: LNA1 (passive antenna) and LNA2 (active antenna), mixer, complex IF filter 2.5/4.2/9.66 MHz, PGA/AGC, 1-3 bit ADC to ~50 Msps, fractional-N synthesizer, reference 8-32 MHz; 3-wire write-only SPI (28 data + 4 address bits); AEC-Q100; 28-TQFN 5x5 EP"
